  "body": "Uninterrupted Gulf views, reinforced concrete construction and award-recognised design define this brand-new 446sqm Castor Bay residence, created for exceptional living and generations to come. Gold Visa Holders' Opportunity !!\r\n\r\n* Panoramic Gulf Views - Spectacular, unobstructed sea views bring a holiday-like atmosphere to everyday living.\r\n* Built for Generations - Substantial reinforced concrete construction combines architectural strength with enduring quality.\r\n* Award-Recognised Kitchen - Highly Commended at the 2026 TIDA Kitchen Awards, designed for everyday pleasure and memorable entertaining.\r\n* Together Yet Independent - 5 bedrooms and three living areas across 4 levels offer space, privacy and flexibility.\r\n* Effortless Living - A private lift connects every floor; the top-level master retreat enjoys its own sea-view balcony.\r\n* Private Leisure - A swimming pool, dedicated cinema and wine cellar enrich time spent at home.\r\n* Work and Welcome - A separate home office, double garage and 3 additional parking spaces complete the offering.\r\n* Coastal Convenience - Beaches, walks and cafes nearby, with Milford, Takapuna and sought-after Westlake school zones within easy reach.\r\n* AIP Opportunity - A premium New Zealand residence for eligible AIP visa holders.\r\n\r\n Documents Download : https://tinyurl.com/52beachrd\r\n\r\nThe expansive main living floor brings everyone together, while children and teenagers enjoy their own bedroom level and cinema. Above, the peaceful master retreat and an additional bedroom accommodate changing family needs.\r\n\r\nThe designer kitchen connects with dining and entertaining spaces, flowing towards outdoor living. From poolside gatherings to quiet weekends overlooking the Gulf, this is a home for shared occasions and personal escape, set within Castor Bay's peaceful seaside surroundings.\r\n\r\nContact Roman Hu at 021 590 027 for viewing. Conjunctional sales are welcome.",
